                                                "sense_id": "0b5e06e0-0250-3ac6-9e23-f56a6295dc4e",
                                                "text": "The graphic design of secondary schoolbooks, which includes many text boxes, captions, labelled diagrams, thought bubbles, etc., introduced a certain level of noise into the scanning and OCR[.]"
